<h3><u>Bhai ki laash pe</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Haaye<br />
Aye behen zainab - 4</p>

<p>Shabe aashur ye shabbir ne kaha zaynab se<br />
Aye behen zaynab aye behen zaynab</p>

<p>Bhai ki laash pe maqtal me jo aana zaynab - 2<br />
Ho sake to - 2 meri bacchi ko na laana zaynab</p>

<p>Bhai ki laash pe maqtal me jo aana zaynab - 2</p>

<p>1. Baap se beti to maa bete se hoti hai qareeb<br />
Maa ko mazloomi sunayega tumhari ye gareeb<br />
Tum garibi meri baba ko sunana zaynab</p>

<p>2. Kalse baagi ki behen tumko kaha jaayega<br />
Taaziyano se tumhe pursa diya jaayega<br />
Badle lega mere tumse ye zamana zaynab</p>

<p>3. Raat me uthte hai is dar ke janaze bibi<br />
Sar se chadar jo chhini tum bhi to mar jaaogi<br />
Tum andhere me mere laashe pe aana zaynab</p>

<p>4. Haaye shimr jis waqt chalaye meri gardan pe churi<br />
Zibha hote hue baba ko na dekhe beti<br />
Dare khayma se sakina ko hatana zaynab</p>

<p>5. Kahi abbas na sunle meri baate ye behen<br />
Haath wo chumlu bandh jaayegi kal jinme rasan<br />
Zara kuch der charago ko bujana zaynab</p>

<p>6. Pura abbas ki madar ka ho arman behen<br />
Paani pyaso ko jo pilwaogi tum jaake watan<br />
Sakka abbas ke bete ko banana zaynab</p>

<p>7. Ek ehsan ye karna aye mere baba ki jaan<br />
Is baras aaye madine me jo gyara shaban<br />
Farshe majlis ali akbar ka bichana zaynab</p>

<p>8. Haayee shabe ashur ki majlis thi takallum jaari<br />
Chup hue kehke ye shabbir behen se apni<br />
Tumko bazar me beparda hai jana zaynab</p>
</p>
